        "Description": "Good evening, Agent. The Velvet Vanguard has embedded itself within the luxury of the Himmapan Hotel, using a global rock tour as a front for international money laundering and asset movement.\r\rEliminate the targets:\r• Barat (The Manager)\r• De Silva (The Operative)\r• Santoro (The Contact)\r• Liston (The Audio Tech)\r• Mookjai (The Enabler)\r\rExpose the syndicate&apos;s operational cover under the guise of the music industry. Good luck.",
